	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060100"},
		line=913,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kahaku... What have you done...?”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Dark, blood-red clouds descend to cover the sky.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"In an instant, the rising sun lighting the city aglow with its radiance is snuffed out.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"The streetlamps scattered across the city are all extinguished one by one, as the oppressive shadows beat back even the faintest sources of light.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The pillar of darkness rising up from the Barrier must be the cause.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kahaku finally makes his appearance.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"We've been ready to depart at a moment's notice ever since last night.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Grabbing my spellblade, I leap to my feet.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Let's stick to our plan.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You pin Kahaku down, and I'll seal him away.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And if that fails, I'll take him down with me.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Meeting eyes with Akari, we share a firm nod.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Snow?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Looking up at the sky, I spot ink-black snowflakes fluttering down, one after another.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"As I catch one in my palm, it sends an indescribable chill through my body.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"I think back to the world of black snow I saw back in Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"That soundless world of desolation where lifeless priestesses lie in eternal slumber.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"This black snow could only be karmic distortions.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"A phenomenon that distorts causality and negates karmic order─a phenomenon that could only be called a cancer on this world.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The unnatural, unseasonal snow is falling down all over Tenkyo.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Within the hour, all of Tenkyo's five million residents will freeze and perish beneath its shadow.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The greatest tragedy the Empire has ever witnessed will soon be upon us─",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wait!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Akari places a hand on my chest.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"She closes her eyes and turns her head towards the sky, as though tracking the faint scent of prey.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kahaku isn't at the Barrier.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He's over there.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Akari points towards the final resting place of all Emperors past.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“He can't hide his presence, no matter how hard he tries.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm worried about the Barrier as well, but we need to take care of Kahaku first.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, let's move!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Lifting Akari in my arms, I leap across the rooftops.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"The air grows perceptibly thicker as soon as we alight in front of the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Though I cannot see it, I can still feel the dense flow of magicks coiling around my body.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I break out into a cold sweat as an overpowering sensation of dread creeps up my spine.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Kahaku lies just beyond─",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Amid the oppressive silence, a melody like the whispers of the dead reaches my ears.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The battle will soon be upon us.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"This may be the very last time I am able to stand at Akari's side.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"At that thought, I feel a rending pain in my chest as though my heart is being squeezed tight.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I am hopelessly terrified that Akari might be hurt─that I might lose her forever.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(I've gotten weak.)”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Determination and apprehension each vie to wrest control of my heart.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"I've stood upon countless battlefields, but I have never felt like this before.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"I am impossibly far from the domain of “heart and blade in concord.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"But this is who I am now.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"I have nothing to be ashamed of.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"The whistling stops as we step into the Imperial Tomb.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"The man sitting on the stone steps to the sepulcher finally pulls his eyes away from the cityscape and turns to face us.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“What do you think? Has there ever been a vista as beautiful as this?”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“All those people freezing over and breathing their last, buried beneath two thousand years' worth of the Empire's negative inheritance.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“After all this time, the Empire is finally getting its just deserts!”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's the ugliest sight I've ever seen.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh, how I've missed that sharp tongue of yours!”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But still, you just might break my heart...”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“For two thousand years, I've searched and searched for the most beautiful vista in the land, all that I could please you.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why are you so obsessed with Himi-no-Mikoto?”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Because I love her.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Just kidding!”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Just like you, I'm a tool created from nothing. I don't know the first thing about love.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"A tool?",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"As I am now, I am filled with far too many emotions to be called a tool.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"My overflowing sentiments, my irrepressible love for\nAkari─they've well and truly sullied the purpose for which I was created.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“But you see, Himi-no-Mikoto gave purpose to my existence.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“Before I met her, I just killed according to my instincts, but as soon as she asked me to render unto her the most beautiful vista known to this world, I knew what I had to do.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I mean, it's not like I needed an excuse to go and kill people, but it sure made things a lot more exciting.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“For that, you have my sincerest gratitude, Himi-no-Mikoto.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Kahaku lowers his head towards Akari.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sorry, but the only one here is Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Founding Empress isn't with us anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"Kahaku raises his head, taking a closer look at Akari.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"His eyes narrow in amusement.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Oh dearie me, I certainly wasn't expecting a twist like this.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Don't tell me the two of you went and ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"killed",
{"/font"},
" Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Alas, poor Mitsurugi. How my heart goes out to you.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“To meet such a cruel fate after waiting for two thousand years to be reunited with Himi-no-Mikoto... Oh, the humanity!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Kahaku sizes us up with a wicked smile.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Seems like you two didn't listen to a word of what I said back in Inner Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you cared in the slightest about the Empire's future, you\nshould've left everything to Himi-no-Mikoto and Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Yet you just ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"had",
{"/font"},
" to go and put your own feelings first.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I suppose I can let Miyaguni-san off the hook... But Soujin, you have absolutely no excuses.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“At the end of the day, the two of us are both tools, are we not?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Is playing at being human so much fun that you were willing to kill Himi-no-Mikoto for it?”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Reason played no part in my decision.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Once the flames of my love were ignited, they could not be quenched.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I have no regrets about what I did.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Well then, let's just see you try and cut me down with your blade drenched in love.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“It looks awfully dull from where I stand!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“True, I am no longer an unthinking tool.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"I draw the blade I took from the student council office.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even so, I will kill you!”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Sure you will...”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Kahaku rises to his feet.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"All of a sudden, a jet-black spellblade materializes in his hand.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The spellblade ",
{"ruby", text="Abaddon"},
"Kakuriyo",
{"/ruby"},
"─the very essence of the unremitting black snow made manifest.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This will be the hundredth time we cross blades.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The fact that you remember warms my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There won't be a hundred-and-first!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I point the tip of my blade towards Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin, of the Myougikan.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“No name worth giving.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Have at you!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Leaping off the ground, I swipe my blade directly at his neck.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"As his blade crosses mine, I fling him away with all my might.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"His body crunches sickeningly against the sepulcher at his back.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Without a second's hesitation─",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I close the distance between us, plunging my blade into his throat.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Gah... guuh...”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"My blade pierces his windpipe, burying itself in the solid stone behind him.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"A spurt of fresh blood spatters across my face.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Nicely... done...”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ghh!”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Suddenly, a searing pain plunges into my stomach.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I realize too late that Kahaku has also run me through with his blade.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Soujin, you've been the only thing on my mind all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Fighting you, killing you, being killed by you, those were the only things that brought color to my dull, dull existence.”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Come, let's have at it to our hearts' content!”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Before Kahaku manages to land his kick at me, I tumble backwards, taking my distance.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"Both of our mortal wounds knit themselves closed like a motion picture played in reverse.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oooooaargh!”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Once again, I leap forward, closing the distance.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"My lunge impales his left arm, and my slash severs his right.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Yet his amputated arm viciously gouges out my flank before immediately reattaching itself.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Any ordinary human would have already died several times over.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"However, our wounds mend themselves in the blink of an eye, and our fight begins anew once more.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"This lavishly brutal, wholly futile exchange of violence continues on and on.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"All for the purpose of focusing Kahaku's attention solely on me.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Akari's seal will be the decisive blow which wins the day.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Haah... Is that all you've got?”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"He slumps his shoulders with a theatrical sigh.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“I was really looking forward to seeing this 'power of love' of yours in action, but I suppose I got my hopes up for nothing.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“You're getting so worked up that you're telegraphing all your moves in advance.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“As you are now, you couldn't hope to beat me.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The both of us are undying. Any difference in our strength is immaterial!”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Is it really that simple?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Think back to what happened during the war.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“After you got blown to smithereens, it took three whole days for you to regain consciousness.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The more grievous your wounds, the longer it takes for you to recover.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"In other words, even though I cannot die, I still can't afford to suffer excessive injuries.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If you hope to defeat me, cast aside your worthless emotions already!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“The life of a tool is the only life for us!”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Kahaku leaps off the ground.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(He's fast!)”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Unable to dodge, I barely manage to parry his lightning-fast flash of steel.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"As our blades cross, they grind into each other with an ear-splitting screech.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh..! Gah!”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"My blade is pushed back, and Kahaku's steel rips into my shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“See? Hearing your lover call your name made you weaker.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“If this is how playing at being human ends for you, Himi-no-Mikoto will never rest in peace!”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I... refuse to return to the way I was!”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“In that case, you can perish alongside the Empire!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The force behind Kahaku's blade suddenly intensifies several-fold.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gwaaaaaaaaagh!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"His blade slowly cleaves through my collarbone, grinding its way through my shoulder blade.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"I clench my teeth so hard at the searing pain that they shatter in my mouth.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“One such as you who kills only on instinct... could never understand...”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What it means to fight!”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"In the two thousand years since my creator granted me life, I have stood astride hundreds of battlefields and claimed thousands upon thousands of lives.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"In order to defend the Empire, in order to protect my lord, I fought and fought.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Just as Kahaku lives only to kill, I likewise lived as an unthinking tool, merely fulfilling the purpose I was given.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Yet I willingly forsook Himi-no-Mikoto out of my love for Akari.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Right now, I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"choose to fight",
{"/font"},
" in order to protect Akari, wielding a blade irrevocably tainted by my passions.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"My actions are utterly irredeemable, utterly irresponsible─",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Wholly unbecoming of a tool created for the sole purpose of defending the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"But I still take pride in the choices I made.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"As I am now, I possess the purity of will accorded only to those who choose their own path.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"Even if I am made to bleed, even if I am forced to kneel, I will never cast aside my emotions.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"I refuse to return to being a mere tool.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The meaning of fighting... is not to fulfill a role... but to place your life on the line in order to protect what's precious...”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No tool is capable of choosing that path... Only humans can!”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“My, doesn't that sound wonderful... but won't you think of all those poor people you're condemning to die?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“To me, the only one worth pitying is one such as you, compelled to murder others for no purpose!”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Hmph...”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Kahaku puts more strength into his blade.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nggghh!”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"My shoulder blade splits with a sickening crunch.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"His blade proceeds further yet, carving through my ribcage.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“*Hack...!*”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"I cough up an enormous lungful of blood.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“There's simply no justice in this world if you're the only one who gets to become human, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Heh... Even you... envied them, did you?”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“...This conversation is over.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Good luck stitching the two halves of yourself back together!”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kahaku!”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"A dignified voice rings out, loud and clear.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"At some point, Akari had moved to stand behind Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Her body is wreathed in the faint light of the sun.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Terrible mighty Oomikami, Thy humble servant beseeches Thee, bestow of me Thy powers Lordly...”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“What's this, now?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"The invocation tumbles effortlessly from Akari's lips.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"She recites it flowingly, unhesitatingly, as though it were a rite she's conducted countless times.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I can't let Kahaku get away now.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"Forcing my numb body into action, I pin him down firmly in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're not going anywhere!”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ngh?!”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“With Thy sunspun chains wrought in divinity, I beseech Thee, bind the villain before me!”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Golden chains extend from Akari's body, and with a will of their own, shackle themselves around Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“A-A seal?!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hear me, Oomikami! By the power of the sun, banish him for good and all!”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“To the farthest reaches of darkness where even Thy light does not shine! To a desolate prison of despair beyond even the abyssal plains!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Layer upon layer of chains continue to coil themselves tightly around him.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Ah... ahh...”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"The chains shackling Kahaku's entire body retract, pulling him slowly away from me.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"His outstretched arms are so completely wrapped in chains that I cannot even see his form underneath.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
